[{"sha":"a2a760da83c84c2566d959f3f63af291e2dd05f4","node_id":"C_kwDOUvGiUNoAKGEyYTc2MGRhODNjODRjMjU2NmQ5NTlmM2Y2M2FmMjkxZTJkZDA1ZjQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"dplaya.min","email":"dplaya.min@samsungsds.com","date":"2026-09-23T05:04:35Z"},"committer":{"name":"dplaya.min","email":"dplaya.min@samsungsds.com","date":"2026-09-23T05:05:24Z"},"message":"기준선: 3단계 설계 문서 완료 + 4단계 기계 처리\n\n- 설계 문서 151개(99,572행), JSON Schema 35개, ADR 38건 + 인덱스, openapi.yaml(51 연산)\n- 3단계 기록물: 진행 보고서, 문서 원장, 바이블 개정 요청 통합 목록, 완전성 검토, 추적 매트릭스\n- 4단계 기계 처리: 용어집 ID 접두 전환(GL-/PL-), 감사기 A10 추가, 사전 감사 결과\n- 도구: validate-contracts, audit-docs, ledger, traceability, phase3/4/5/6 워크플로우 스크립트\n- LICENSE(Apache-2.0), NOTICE, schemas/README\n\n주의: 4단계 워크플로우(문서 정합화)가 실행 중인 시점의 스냅숏이며 일부 docs/ 파일은 편집 중일 수 있다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2dd7557c285c6ec2936dcf7d4039c1edf9e18bf3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dplayamin-ai/rag-platform/git/trees/2dd7557c285c6ec2936dcf7d4039c1edf9e18bf3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dplayamin-ai/rag-platform/git/commits/a2a760da83c84c2566d959f3f63af291e2dd05f4","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dplayamin-ai/rag-platform/commits/a2a760da83c84c2566d959f3f63af291e2dd05f4","html_url":"https://github.com/dplayamin-ai/rag-platform/commit/a2a760da83c84c2566d959f3f63af291e2dd05f4","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dplayamin-ai/rag-platform/commits/a2a760da83c84c2566d959f3f63af291e2dd05f4/comments","author":null,"committer":null,"parents":[]}]